        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Orlea's Gimmick is all about Retain and her Creations that Exhaust\nRetain means the card isn't discarded at the End of Turn\nSome of Orlea's Cards also have Activated Abilities by Retaining\nEnding turn, or Growth Acceleration can Activate these Abilities\nOrlea has 3 types of creations:\nUse Effect: Multiplicative Damage Bonus to next attack used\nRetain Effect: Multiplicative Damage Bonus to next attack used\nUse Effect: Does Damage\nRetain Effect: Increases Swifties damage by a Additive Damage Ammount\nSturdie/Toughie: The Sustain\nUse Effect: Shields\nRetain Effect: Heals\n(Yes, Retain heal generates Tressa Daggers, End of Turn and Growth Accel)\nCreations have 3 star levels, Creations combine if Same Type, Increasing Star\nIncreasing Stars boost the Retain effect and Use strength\nExamples:\nSoft 1 + Soft 1 = Soft 2\nSoft 2 + Soft 1 = Soft 3\nSoft 2 + Soft 2 = Soft 2, Soft 2\nSoft 1+ Sturdie 1 = Can't happen"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": {
            "en": "2/4 Patch notes"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Growth Accel got healing buffs nice\nAll Creations got numbers buffs\nWill of Light got AP reduced to 1, very nice\nBut it still of Activates them once (It should be twice)\nPotential change AMAZING\nBasics change, whatever you just remove em"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
